        {"vs": "46", "note": "Frostbite burns through Refraction charges fast, and Freezing Field still damages her under Meld until she buys Blink Dagger.", "items": ["Blink Dagger"]},
        {"vs": "109", "note": "Crystal Nova and Freezing Field shred his illusions and threaten him early without Black King Bar, and he has no cheap way to cancel Freezing Field.", "items": ["Abyssal Blade", "Black King Bar", "Glimmer Cape", "Manta Style", "Scythe of Vyse", "Shadow Blade", "Silver Edge"]},
