        {"vs": "21", "note": "Windrun negates Omnislash damage and outruns Blade Fury, and Focus Fire ignores the spell immunity entirely.", "items": []},
        {"vs": "119", "note": "None of her spells pierce spell immunity, so Blade Fury dispels Cursed Crown/Bramble Maze and shuts her out, and she's fragile enough for Omnislash to end her fast (unless Shadow Realm negates the attack damage).", "items": []},
        {"vs": "58", "note": "Blade Fury dispels her slow and burns her down early, Omnislash/Swiftslash ignore Untouchable's evasion, and Silver Edge bypasses it entirely.", "items": ["Silver Edge"]},
