        {"vs": "90", "note": "Healing Ward outsustains Illuminate pressure, Blade Fury dispels Blinding Light and dodges Illuminate while still hitting towers, and his low health/armor make him easy to punish once Aghanim's Will-o-Wisp is dealt with.", "items": ["Aghanim's Scepter"]},
        {"vs": "36", "note": "Blade Fury blocks Death Pulse and Reaper's Scythe damage outright, and Ghost Shroud actually makes him take more Blade Fury damage.", "items": []},
        {"vs": "88", "note": "Blade Fury grants immunity to everything except Vendetta, and Omnislash/Swiftslash ignore Spiked Carapace (though Vendetta can still cancel the slash).", "items": []},
