        {"vs": "46", "note": "Blade Fury's damage-over-time dispels Refraction almost instantly, and his armor lets him tank long enough to threaten Omnislash if his team can spot her.", "items": []},
        {"vs": "22", "note": "Blade Fury blocks his entire kit, and his short range/no defenses mean he dies fast once cornered, Omnislash or not.", "items": []},
