        {"vs": "5", "note": "Sacred Arrow interrupts Freezing Field from a safe distance, her terrible mobility makes her easy arrow bait, and Leap still escapes even through Crystal Nova/Freezing Field's slow.", "items": ["Aghanim's Scepter"]},
