        {"vs": "96", "note": "Hoof Stomp and Double Edge clear his illusions fast, and Retaliate with Blade Mail reflects his damage right back.", "items": ["Blade Mail"]},
        {"vs": "55", "note": "Ion Shell picks off illusions to expose the real one, and Surge lets his team simply outrun the chase.", "items": []},
        {"vs": "49", "note": "Breathe Fire/Elder Dragon splash clears illusions fast, and landing Dragon Tail on the real one can end the fight.", "items": []},
        {"vs": "7", "note": "AoE stuns clear his illusions fast (worse with Aghanim's cleave), though Echo Slam's damage does scale hugely off the illusion count.", "items": ["Aghanim's Scepter"]},
