        {"vs": "113", "note": "One of his hardest counters -- Arc Warden's single-target kit can't keep up with the illusion count, Flux pauses if any illusion is near, Phantom Rush closes in on Magnetic Field, and a Diffusal Blade drains his mana fast enough to starve Tempest Double.", "items": ["Diffusal Blade"]},
